[Lok Lambert]]. He was among those who surrounded [[Dante's house]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nKoskin attempted to stop the Huntik team but was in vain. {{Source|Doorway to Huntik}}","text":"Koskin attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal from Lok Lambert. He was among those who surrounded Dante's house. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nKoskin attempted to stop the Huntik team but was in vain. [Doorway to Huntik]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, Koskin was issued with the standard [[Titans]] of the Organization.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, Koskin was issued with the standard Titans of the Organization."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost\n* Hyperstride\n* Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Mindrone]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Strix]]\n\n{{col-end}}","text":"* Mindrone\n* Redcap\n* Strix"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nFile:Koskin.png\nFile:Mr. Koskin.jpg\n</gallery>","text":"File:Koskin.png\nFile:Mr. Koskin.jpg"},{"heading":"Trivia","level":2,"wikitext":"* In the first series trailer, Koskin possessed gray hair and was paired with [[Ms. Thorpe|Thorpe]].\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"* In the first series trailer, Koskin possessed gray hair and was paired with Thorpe."}],"full_text":"Mr. Koskin is an elite agent of the Organization and served as one of DeFoe's Suits.\n\n== History ==\nKoskin attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal from Lok Lambert. He was among those who surrounded Dante's house. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nKoskin attempted to stop the Huntik team but was in vain. [Doorway to Huntik]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Koskin was issued with the standard Titans of the Organization.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* Augerfrost\n* Hyperstride\n* Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* Mindrone\n* Redcap\n* Strix\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:Koskin.png\nFile:Mr. Koskin.jpg\n\n== Trivia ==\n* In the first series trailer, Koskin possessed gray hair and was paired with Thorpe.","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image  = File:Mr._Koskin.jpg\n| groups = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Blue\n| eyes   = Brown\n| first  = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n|American=Sam Riegel}}\n'''Mr. Koskin''' is an elite agent of the [[Organization]] and served as one of [[DeFoe]]'s [[Suits]].\n\n== History ==\nKoskin attempted to retrieve [[Eathon Lambert's journal]] from [[Lok Lambert]]. He was among those who surrounded [[Dante's house]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nKoskin attempted to stop the Huntik team but was in vain. {{Source|Doorway to Huntik}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, Koskin was issued with the standard [[Titans]] of the Organization.\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Mindrone]]\n* [[Redcap]]\n* [[Strix]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nFile:Koskin.png\nFile:Mr. Koskin.jpg\n</gallery>\n\n== Trivia ==\n* In the first series trailer, Koskin possessed gray hair and was paired with [[Ms. Thorpe|Thorpe]].\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"